a large, fuzzy, keyboard-first picker over every task [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]in the vault. Choosing a task replaces the `((` token with a valid [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Obsidian block link such as `[\\[foo#^bar]]`. A task without a block [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]ID is named first through a prompt prefilled with a good suggested [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]ID. bob-cli owns the trigger grammar, the candidates, the link [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]text, and the ID write; the app only presents them.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]wikilink_task_picker.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/wikilink_task_picker.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-e7[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-e7/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Block-ID suggestions skip link URLs[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]id-suggestions[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]id-suggestions: in bob-cli, make the shared block-ID suggestion [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]generator ignore Markdown link destinations and bare URLs, so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Keep-captured tasks stop suggesting `https-keep-google-com`; update the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pinned tests and the documented algorithm.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli wikilink_task completion contract[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-contract: in bob-cli, detect the `((query` field, serve the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault-wide `wikilink_task` snapshot with backend-formatted [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`[\\[target#^id]]` replacements, groups, disabled reasons, and a picker [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]descriptor, add `wikilink_replacement` to `capture-task-id`, keep shell [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion out of it, and document the contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac Task Wikilink Picker[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-picker[dim] · [dim][/dim]after id-suggestions, bob-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-picker: in bob-mac-capture, add the `.wikilinkTask` picker source [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that decodes `wikilink_task`, auto-opens on typed `((`, filters locally,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inserts Bob's link, runs the Add block ID prompt in wikilink mode [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]against `capture-task-id`, and covers it with presentation, panel, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fake-bob tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac picker design review and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-design-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-picker[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-design-docs: in bob-mac-capture, render light/dark design fixtures [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of the card and ID prompt, review and polish them, show Markdown links [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in task text by their label, and document the picker, keys, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capability row.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-e7","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-e7.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-e7.1"},"source_r